# Windows Encoding

On Windows, never save repository text files as UTF-16 LE.

- Prefer UTF-8 without BOM for scripts and docs
- PowerShell: `[System.IO.File]::WriteAllText(path, content, (New-Object System.Text.UTF8Encoding $false))` or `Set-Content -Encoding utf8`
- UTF-16 corruption breaks `.gitignore`, JSON, YAML, and Gradle/Kotlin tooling
- After suspicious Windows edits, re-open key files and confirm they are not UTF-16
